  "question": {
    "text": "Three persons P, Q and R independently try to hit a target. If the probabilities of their hitting the target are <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> respectively, then the probability that the target is hit by P or Q but not by R is:"
  },
